escription": "AMD AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (radeonsi, gfx1201, ACO, DRM 3.64, 7.1.1-2-cachyos)", "vram_size": 16384}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229706989", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136309986", "personaname": "SatiricalPothole", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198136309986/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 486, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 486, "last_played": 1783277757, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good fun, some difficult fights some nots so much. interesting story and worth the time and price especially if you can get it on sale", "timestamp_created": 1783277864, "timestamp_updated": 1783277864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229680305", "author": {"steamid": "76561199166721044", "personaname": "SnoozyBoy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199166721044/", "num_games_owned": 23, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 663, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 663, "last_played": 1783257985, "avatar": "50767cea96889a121066ed45c098873cb258f8f3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just finished Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine and damn, what a ride. This game makes you feel like an absolute god of war – a 9-foot tall, power-armored killing machine dropped into the grim darkness of the 41st millennium. ￼\r\nThe combat is pure joy. It perfectly blends third-person shooting with brutal melee, and the feedback when you stomp Orks, chainsword a Nob in half, or melt faces with a meltagun is chef’s kiss. Nothing beats revving up that thunder hammer and clearing a room in one satisfying swing. The pacing is excellent too – it constantly throws new weapons, abilities, and enemy types at you so the campaign never gets stale (even if it’s pretty linear). ￼\r\nThe atmosphere nails the Warhammer 40k vibe: massive gothic cathedrals, forge worlds under siege, hordes of screaming greenskins, and that constant sense of overwhelming scale. The voice acting is top-tier (especially Titus and the squad banter), and the soundtrack pumps you up for every battle. Even years later, it looks and feels great.\r\nThe not-so-perfect parts:\r\n•  Campaign is on the shorter side (~8 hours).\r\n•  Some repetition in the back half.\r\n•  Multiplayer is basically dead now. ￼\r\nBut honestly, those are minor complaints for how fun and empowering the core loop is. If you’re a 40k fan or just want a straightforward, ultra-violent action game where you get to be the biggest badass in the galaxy, this is essential.\r\nFor the Emperor. Buy it. Play it. Purge the xenos. 🔥⚔️\r\n(Played on PC – no regrets)", "timestamp_created": 1783258296, "timestamp_updated": 1783258296, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229663982", "author": {"steamid": "76561199436210463", "personaname": "poltergeist666", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199436210463/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 600, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 600, "last_played": 1783208484, "avatar": "4f9fad3747573749cc5bc3b99f20865e71dcf96b"}, "language": "english", "review": "It should have been Leandros, not Sidonus", "timestamp_created": 1783243451, "timestamp_updated": 1783243451, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny"